{
  "id": 384380256,
  "iid": 19892,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TLS: Add historical GOST cipher suite value",
  "description": "TLS_GOSTR341112_256_WITH_28147_CNT_IMIT has a historical 0xff85 value, which has been added\n\nThis cipher suite is used by LibreSSL until version 3.9.0 - macOS 15.4.1 ships with curl using LibreSSL version 3.3.6\n\nRFC reference: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc9189\n\nRelevant excerpt:\n```\nNote that prior to the existence of this document, implementations could use only the values from the \"Private Use\" space in order to use the GOST-based algorithms. So some old implementations can still use the old value {0xFF, 0x85} instead of the {0xC1, 0x02} value to indicate the TLS_GOSTR341112_256_WITH_28147_CNT_IMIT cipher suite;\n```",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-05-19T14:13:48.685Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-05-19T22:29:26.076Z",
